  "stem": "（1）解方程：\\(\\frac { 2x } { x+3 }\\)＝\\(\\frac { 1 } { x+3 }\\)+1；\n（2）解不等式组：\\(\\begin{cases} 4x+2>x-7 \\\\ 3(x-2) < 4+x \\end{cases}\\)",
